Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Zinger, Pineapple, Boss, Biryulka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,5 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Every person has his own weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Superman when meeting kryptonite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,becomes just an eccentric who wears underpants over his pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If Superman is so weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,imagine what happens to ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will reveal the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accept your will, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not her who needs to be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.91,0:02:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you go against the will of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For an ordinary person, this world is a minefield of weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We become each other's weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and we drag everyone to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I, the perfect Jang Bong Hwan, have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is nothing more than...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't stand it when another guy looks cooler than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurt the queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially in the presence of the one I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be the coolest in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say this is the Achilles heel of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,who is perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me, as a victim of this incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,shed light on the events.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think there’s only one cool guy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t twitch, Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the hero here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I tried to kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your false self
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.23,0:04:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried this suicide note with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care if chaos reigns here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you kill yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the night before you became queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was depressed and wanted to die because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure there was a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going to take me away now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t come near. Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is telling a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to save the life\N of a less important person than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in a virtuous heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,forgiving the one\N who committed a sin against her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s how he took it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so interesting here?\N So many people have gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen put in so much effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so be it, I will show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,5 episode: Achilles' heel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen such a sight for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the queen was thinking when she did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is the heart of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’m sure the Kims have nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading to Seonjong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I need something else besides prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a weak royal consort,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but she is our only arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to apply poison to its tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she try to commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll bide my time and wake up at the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of father am I that I didn’t guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have committed a great sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have sinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He should have taken better care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know, you are with her all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to jump into the water several times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was because of the shock during the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Several times?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well damn, that's enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You will cry, I will not wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Will see us in tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,will be very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,At such moments you need to be brave and be close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Soyeon.\N-Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When your mother gave you life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,she lost hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He started again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty has grown,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,not having a chance to see my mother's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know why she suffered so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and I just forbade her from both this and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was chasing her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and grumbled all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because of me that she could
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,jump into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How so, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t cope with this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwanghwamun
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic father
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,asks for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will enter the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will meet the king for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes he looks like an ugly idiot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes as if made of jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night he looked exactly like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed that I had to give up on you in order to make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Before visiting the palace, you were so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, after visiting the palace, she tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really because of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone crazy! I've lost the rest of my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your false self
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She spent several nights with the king. \NAre you sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that he didn’t cloud her brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your anger is of little use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I not be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We missed a great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They shot themselves in the foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see how the king behaved?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That arrogant look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved him from the life of a simple peasant and made him a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,does he dare to look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to pacify him, since he is rebelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tighten the rules so that you know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why waste time taking care of yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no trace of effort, it’s worth worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite healer Pak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, the queen came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That night when I threw myself into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dowager Queen, I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't become a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want such a bitter fate for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors that you're behaving terribly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but all this was on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so as not to become a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could achieve something with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You took classes to become a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know why I suddenly changed my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don’t want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fate was predetermined from birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You must become a queen and serve your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your destiny, this is what you were born for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you taken this position yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't retreat,\N even if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to die, die in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she said that because
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:15:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that young people are now inclined to make mountains out of molehills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I didn’t attach much importance to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t even think that she jumped into the lake to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If she was ready to die,\N just not to become queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so her crazy behavior today too...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to leave the post of queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the queen will not escape unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me! What if you fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you, take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to block my path?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not be able to return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-To the Queen, Jang Bong-hwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,ordered to stay here forever until the end of my days
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:16:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and live in agony, remaining impotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be impotent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What a terrible nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:30.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You tried to drown yourself in the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:32.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and today they fainted, I was so scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:35.58,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Calm down. I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:38.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will die with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:47.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’ve had enough tears for today, I can’t stand it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:53.83,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,It’s not contagious, so why did you cry three times?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.40,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I fell asleep while I was waiting for you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:17:00.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Of course you don’t want to see my tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You're cute when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where is the court lady Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:14.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,She insisted that she would bring you the medicine herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:18.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your father stayed with you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.46,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,and went home only after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:24.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If only we had woken up a little earlier, we would have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:27.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Thank heavens that I didn’t see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:28.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If he finds out what a beautiful body
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.87,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,his priceless daughter was captured by the soul of a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I should be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.74,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,We must hurry before Lady Choi returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The lake has already been filled?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.78,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Do you want to go to the lake at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:46.19,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Today is the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:53.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Are you in a good mood? \N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,All that remains is to return home,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,remaining the coolest guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.17,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,-Honyeon. \N-Yes, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:05.20,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I was able to endure all this thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:08.71,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,I don’t know about the others, but I’ll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:12.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, and I will also miss the court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:17.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Honyeon, leave such a will to your descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:18.58,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:21.85,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Buy land in Gangnam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You have to tell them this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:25.22,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Then in 200 years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,your heirs will live like rich people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:30.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,That's all I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:37.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:40.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,More energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.05,0:18:48.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hurry, need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:55.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why did we return to the old way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.23,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,when did I come up with a new system?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:00.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:04.16,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The well is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:08.87,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,That's why we take water from another
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:11.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and we bring it here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:15.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Will you repeat it again? I heard something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:20.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sounded like you won't finish today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Forgive us, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:25.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Forgive us, queen. \N-Forgive us, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:32.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,A high-ranking official must keep his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:35.66,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,You promised to fill the lake today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:38.26,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Nearest well
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:40.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,very, very far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:43.37,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,It will take at least 15 days...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:48.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please execute me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:54.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Please execute me! \N-Please execute me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:56.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you always asking for execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:00.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You probably don’t believe that I’m really going to execute you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Should I demonstrate it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:05.56,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you want to experience for yourself what kind of scam happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:13.33,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,We've passed. I'm sure even an incomplete lake will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:20.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to take your life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.94,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:25.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.55,0:20:27.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:28.65,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,In short...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:32.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Trying to survive. That's the only way I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:40.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You will only go through my corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:42.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Damn, where do you get so much power?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.40,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.97,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,If this granny changes her mind
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:50.04,Default,Spikilka,0,0,0,,and again get rid of the water in the lake, I’m screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.07,0:20:51.87,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Help stop the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:53.47,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,How dare you touch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:55.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I beg you, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,From now on, no quibbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:03.02,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will never tell you “no”!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:05.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You can’t do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:06.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I said that you won’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:09.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,That you can never say “no”!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:10.66,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:15.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At least tickle me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:33.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I forgot how to laugh a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.32,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:39.09,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I won’t. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:40.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:42.99,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.72,0:21:46.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So you don’t want me to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:50.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:04.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.15,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Straighten your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:12.72,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Can you swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:20.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:24.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’ll go further, it will be deeper there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:26.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:34.07,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,-Fathers. \N-Yes, here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.11,0:22:37.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I tripped!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:41.15,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Bummer. \N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:46.02,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager calls on you to appear immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,To you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:51.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lee Senman. This name backfired on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:53.43,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.43,0:22:56.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Miracle. \N-What bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:57.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,That’s it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:01.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.77,0:23:05.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you sometimes have this feeling too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:09.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,When everyone is fussing around, and no one cares about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:13.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sir, you are the center of the universe for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:17.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, sensitive people like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:20.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,sometimes they make mistakes in their premonitions, like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.89,0:23:25.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I didn’t order naengmyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:28.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You make me happy every night, allowing me to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:30.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let me say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.33,0:23:35.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It will seem that I’m hanging around here for fun, but that’s not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:42.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm just here to find out at least something
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.01,0:23:44.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,about Lee Senman, who suddenly disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:49.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But why are you looking for him so desperately?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:52.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It feels like behind his disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,there is an important secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:58.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The sixth sense tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:01.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,what is this Lee Senman
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:04.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,at the very center of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:07.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-What’s the problem? \N-I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.47,0:24:09.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:22.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,They are checking me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.05,0:24:26.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-About today... \N-It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I forced you to marry him against your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:38.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don’t you really want to be a queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So much so that you are ready to say goodbye to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.57,0:24:42.60,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,And be deposed as a queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:45.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,She tried to commit suicide so as not to be queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.37,0:24:46.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:49.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If you want it so desperately,\NI will let you leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:52.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will depose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:55.31,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,You will be imprisoned in your house
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.31,0:24:57.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and you won’t step outside the threshold for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.35,0:24:58.38,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can only get back through the lake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.62,0:25:03.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I don’t remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:06.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,After falling into the lake, I forgot about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Memories did not return,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.69,0:25:11.56,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but did you remember that you wanted to commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.83,0:25:15.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I still have a feeling of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:17.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I’m sure I embroidered this note.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.04,0:25:21.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But why I wanted to commit suicide, I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.67,0:25:23.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If you don’t remember anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,why did you intervene?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:30.08,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,If you don’t give a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:32.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will assume that you opposed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:33.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.59,0:25:36.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I never thought of resisting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:40.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Today you undermined my authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.39,0:25:41.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I need to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.89,0:25:44.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But I don’t have a solution. Damn, nothing comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.73,0:25:48.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I can’t forgive you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:53.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I deserve to die, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.74,0:25:56.24,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Take my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:59.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm confused due to the lack of memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.11,0:26:00.88,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but I can’t turn away from my kind
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.88,0:26:03.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and from my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.85,0:26:05.75,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Please punish me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.75,0:26:09.92,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,give poison to get rid of this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.03,0:26:15.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,They definitely don’t want to overthrow the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.86,0:26:18.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Is it so easy for you to give up your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:20.10,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,She threw herself into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.10,0:26:21.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Now do you want to drink poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:24.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why are you so weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.34,0:26:27.21,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,They want to make sure they have power over the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:29.17,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,My stupid decision to say goodbye to life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.17,0:26:31.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,created all this misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:33.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,My action is worthy of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.71,0:26:38.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I beg you to execute me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.45,0:26:41.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your death will not fix anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:42.42,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Because of this trick
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:44.69,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,the Queen Mother will gain an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.69,0:26:46.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But this will not only affect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.89,0:26:51.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This will affect the entire Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:54.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-I'll try... \N-Calm down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:04.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’ll ask you for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.05,0:27:09.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you really want to leave the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:12.35,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:15.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,live in a palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.69,0:27:20.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What do you think, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:32.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Since I have no memories left, I will become a new person.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.64,0:27:38.71,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I will become an ideal queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.21,0:27:44.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I don’t believe empty promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:46.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’ll prove it in practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.25,0:27:50.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please give her a chance, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.83,0:27:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't bother you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.27,0:28:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Leave your false self"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.41,0:28:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we no longer have weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We will eliminate
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,any problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.03,0:28:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.10,0:28:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is so unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.55,0:28:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Light more lanterns, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.99,0:28:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No. This is me talking about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.43,0:29:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong and his men searched the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.07,0:29:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.07,0:29:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Were these the royal guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.31,0:29:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They are well trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Seven.\N-For all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.85,0:29:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,they secretly trained only seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are out of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.49,0:29:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for the disease, you would have become an excellent warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.89,0:29:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,only thanks to your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.96,0:29:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.90,0:29:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make a mistake again,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you will not receive any more medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.11,0:29:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.69,0:30:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we thought that the queen fell into the lake to frame concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.14,0:30:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We believed that she was deliberately lying about losing her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.54,0:30:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe she tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.01,0:30:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is how she wanted to gain your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.41,0:30:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think she knew that I would protect Concubine Cho?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.55,0:30:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t stand up for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the queen would blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,which can influence you in this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.79,0:30:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, you see
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,there is evil intent in every action of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.63,0:30:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen -
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,support of the Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.37,0:30:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of people are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.47,0:30:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the ones who massacred our entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.84,0:30:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I never
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.35,0:31:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t forget this either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.59,0:31:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But look what the queen did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.12,0:31:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite my attempt to kill her and my enmity with Concubine Cho,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,she revealed the truth for our sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Still think your hostility towards her
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,deserved?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.54,0:31:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-If this was a suicide attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.01,0:31:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,then I killed the queen twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.10,0:31:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.97,0:32:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.57,0:32:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are only complicating everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.24,0:32:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My fate is already in the hands of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.75,0:32:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'll just pass on the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.42,0:32:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,because I’m from the Andong family of Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t say I didn’t like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.40,0:32:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were not from the Andon clan of Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.51,0:32:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,would you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don’t think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.14,0:32:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You became a queen thanks to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.68,0:32:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I put in a lot of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.62,0:32:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to become a queen because of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.72,0:32:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I dedicated my whole life to this, no matter what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you will get what you so desperately wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.80,0:33:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s late, and tomorrow will be a hard day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.30,0:33:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to your chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.31,0:33:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You must love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.45,0:33:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this an order?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.22,0:33:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My indifference made her jump into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If she tried to commit suicide because of your indifference,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.93,0:33:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,she would just jump into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.97,0:33:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But she forged the letter and fell in front of Concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see an ulterior motive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.91,0:33:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Motive, speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.21,0:33:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.28,0:33:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Criminals do not hide their smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.38,0:33:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was an ulterior motive in her actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:33:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell by her behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.69,0:34:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Concubine Cho for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.62,0:34:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretend to be the perfect queen for 15 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.79,0:34:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.72,0:34:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can’t, then I’ll remain in this suffocating body,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,besides, behind bars as a deposed queen in the Joseon era.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.07,0:34:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I dug my own grave. Who else is to blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.60,0:34:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the king has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.97,0:34:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course Cheoljong.\N It’s all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t have stood up for her if he weren’t so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.42,0:34:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.95,0:35:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And even before that he completely blundered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.09,0:35:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman wouldn't try
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.59,0:35:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,drown, if he were nicer to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, if he had done this before...\N-My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.80,0:35:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.13,0:35:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You put a sword to my neck,\N where does this concern come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.27,0:35:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a single quiet day here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just opened my eyes, and tomorrow is the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.58,0:35:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The husband with whom I share the same blanket is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And even my own family\N threatens to overthrow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.75,0:35:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Overthrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.82,0:35:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Tempting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.66,0:35:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a good opportunity to replace me with Cho Hwajin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.56,0:35:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t come to fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.43,0:35:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at you makes me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.23,0:35:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you thought about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You who tried to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.07,0:35:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and the one for whom you are ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.14,0:35:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to die trying to save you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.31,0:35:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they will kill me before I commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone in my place would be angry right now if he weren’t a Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you are very angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.39,0:36:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.02,0:36:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.32,0:36:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.16,0:36:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.46,0:36:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have understood me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.06,0:36:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,before putting the sword to my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You should have understood this woman before
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.54,0:36:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,how she tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment has passed. There's no point in saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away already. I was tired while I was angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.95,0:36:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back when you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.89,0:36:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t come unless you’re ready to beg on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.17,0:36:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.60,0:37:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they filling the lake again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.24,0:37:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty asked the Dowager Queen about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.28,0:37:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.01,0:37:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I heard Her Majesty went to the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and personally monitored everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.20,0:38:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.47,0:38:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that I might lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.42,0:38:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.39,0:38:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound hurts more,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.49,0:38:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it was very hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.57,0:38:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for dragging you into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.57,0:38:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been so difficult for you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.04,0:38:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,because of all these problems in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.58,0:38:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want you to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.55,0:38:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.52,0:38:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sacrifice yourself for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,how do I deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.06,0:39:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not do what you are afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.73,0:39:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Until everything settles down,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.23,0:39:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong will personally guard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well...\N-Mr. Hong has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.44,0:39:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.11,0:39:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As a maid of Concubine Cho?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the infirmary now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.62,0:39:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother will take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.93,0:39:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you met the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.20,0:39:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.23,0:39:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-How is she?\N-She was angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.74,0:39:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Blamed me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.20,0:39:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that he drove her to suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.27,0:39:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hates me for trying to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.18,0:39:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Emotions overwhelm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.51,0:39:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If she wanted to win me over,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.58,0:39:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,then I wouldn’t behave like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.25,0:39:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And more
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.05,0:40:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kims threaten to overthrow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.82,0:40:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byungin doesn’t know yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.29,0:40:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that scrap from your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.13,0:40:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.13,0:40:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know her intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.43,0:40:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems to act on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I would understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.47,0:40:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of person she is, based on her actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But she only puzzled me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.65,0:40:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, this is Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.82,0:40:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.56,0:40:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.87,0:40:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.48,0:41:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.48,0:41:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.15,0:41:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to reason with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.09,0:41:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she doesn’t understand, she won’t exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.46,0:41:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.03,0:41:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,About anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.73,0:41:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,An ally for centuries does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.77,0:41:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid now is not the time for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.37,0:41:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.78,0:41:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.81,0:41:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided how far I would go with my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.18,0:41:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Very glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.98,0:41:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What position?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.39,0:41:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be the head of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.66,0:41:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective department?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.99,0:41:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a warrior is everything you dreamed of?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.26,0:41:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start with a position I can handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.60,0:41:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will choose my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.90,0:41:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.04,0:42:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you want to choose your own path?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.58,0:42:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal concubine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.22,0:42:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.50,0:42:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.47,0:42:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.50,0:42:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to stand until the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.17,0:42:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your broken knees are proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.64,0:42:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.65,0:42:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.18,0:42:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of days with medicinal herbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.39,0:42:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll be up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.79,0:42:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I have no doubt you will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.89,0:42:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could treat you so cruelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t see his face, he was wearing a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I remember the voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.70,0:43:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.94,0:43:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for saying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.98,0:43:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone not from the royal family is injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.21,0:43:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,he cannot stay in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.85,0:43:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can she leave in such a state?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a palace custom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.65,0:43:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no compassion in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.20,0:43:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone is on the way
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.36,0:43:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,will try to harm you, use it as a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.20,0:43:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Successfully leave the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,take advantage of this to live in comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.80,0:43:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.64,0:43:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send a letter to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.88,0:43:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.55,0:43:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.15,0:43:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to look at Mr. Cho's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.96,0:43:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.62,0:44:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ovol, you and I grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.66,0:44:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.80,0:44:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to hold out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.07,0:44:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.90,0:44:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be brave for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.91,0:44:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You must live.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.28,0:44:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.71,0:44:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-What happened?\N -Yesterday it was a madhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.18,0:44:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.45,0:44:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.62,0:45:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.18,0:45:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty cast thunder and lightning at the Dowager Queen with his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.49,0:45:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The eyes were like apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.76,0:45:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.93,0:45:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty picked her up right in front of the queen and...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.57,0:45:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal chef, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.77,0:45:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty grabbed the sword,\Nand the dowager queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.34,0:45:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that there was something in the Tongunjeong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they do this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.73,0:45:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The head of the Detective Department will be appointed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.63,0:45:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an assignment request.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.10,0:45:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And who was recommended
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.47,0:45:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for the post of head of the Detective Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.37,0:45:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Byonin from the Andong Kim clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.52,0:46:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.92,0:46:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure there are many candidates for this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.32,0:46:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I appoint as head someone who has passed the civil servant exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.59,0:46:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be complaints, don’t you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.36,0:46:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We unanimously agreed\N with this recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.43,0:46:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unanimously?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.70,0:46:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect such harmonious relations among my subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.17,0:46:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he is a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.58,0:46:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the Royal Notice of Appointment been prepared yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.02,0:46:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep up with your fast decisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.56,0:46:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps I should reduce my sleep time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.46,0:46:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.43,0:46:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to take care of your health\Nand produce an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.76,0:46:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a king, but a breeding horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.02,0:47:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have always been humble. \NDon't lose it - humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.09,0:47:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.27,0:47:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pungyang Cho Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.04,0:47:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,brought trouble upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.37,0:47:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the false confession of the concubine
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.61,0:47:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we have experienced such humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.22,0:47:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure is a cause, not a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.39,0:47:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.09,0:47:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So said the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.29,0:47:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed with the appointment of Kim Byungin
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.50,0:48:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and helped them strengthen their positions,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.20,0:48:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,because we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.14,0:48:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The more defeats, the less\N our chances of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.47,0:48:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She said,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.67,0:48:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we must take the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.20,0:48:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Ovol will be able to recover?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.41,0:48:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check how she's feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.38,0:48:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She is active, so she constantly rushes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.55,0:48:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it won’t be able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.05,0:48:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If she had not come to the palace with me,..
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.92,0:48:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about it too often.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.12,0:49:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes thoughts can drive you into a swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.89,0:49:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the harder you fight, the deeper it goes. \NIt will hurt even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.66,0:49:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.47,0:49:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to clear your head from the abundance of thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.51,0:49:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,going to Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.74,0:49:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He can comfort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.94,0:49:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.41,0:49:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.72,0:49:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I take my anger out on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,then I get out of the swamp without even noticing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.82,0:49:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can you make me angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.26,0:49:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-This...\N-Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.88,0:50:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.17,0:50:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.24,0:51:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.65,0:51:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.05,0:51:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does something hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.92,0:51:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.86,0:51:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.47,0:51:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.30,0:51:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so focused that you forgot about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.86,0:51:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to embroider,\Nthen you had to go to the Daejojeon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.06,0:51:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you forget in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really embroidering something?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.94,0:52:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to transform myself into an exemplary queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Exemplary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.85,0:52:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to do? Give me some work?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.98,0:52:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.05,0:52:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And when will I figure all this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.16,0:52:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.06,0:52:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Enter.\N-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.84,0:52:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this from the Dongmyeongjong Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.97,0:52:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Your Majesty. \N-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.48,0:52:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried my dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.62,0:52:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the old ones seem boring to her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.03,0:53:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Take this to the stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.13,0:53:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If they cover the food palanquin with a blanket of this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.90,0:53:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,food will not cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.54,0:53:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.37,0:53:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.14,0:53:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you rush to the lake as soon as you get rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.65,0:53:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone work so hard while they're about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.65,0:53:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you seem to have forgotten,\Nthis has become the norm,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.05,0:53:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but I’m under surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.83,0:53:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.27,0:53:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go create miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.02,0:53:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.39,0:53:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.90,0:54:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.67,0:54:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there. Did you chop the meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.90,0:54:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.77,0:54:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.61,0:54:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me some salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.54,0:54:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen wants me to serve her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.12,0:54:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.75,0:54:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.92,0:54:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.00,0:54:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I ask the queen to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.04,0:54:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is the Chief Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.61,0:54:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has prepared lunch for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.25,0:55:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to take it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.56,0:55:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.99,0:55:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there is no delicacy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.60,0:55:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.17,0:55:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lunch has arrived, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.65,0:55:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.72,0:55:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.69,0:56:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen said that
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.05,0:56:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the topic of today's lunch is HSNV.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.63,0:56:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,HSNV?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.13,0:56:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.50,0:56:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Mencius?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.17,0:56:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it’s not. \NMaybe from the Analects of Confucius?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.21,0:56:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This means that
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.57,0:56:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,food is crispy on the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.24,0:56:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and tender inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.41,0:56:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.76,0:56:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The palanquin with food has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.77,0:57:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Take the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.88,0:57:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.45,0:57:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.09,0:57:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She was very pleased and praised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.26,0:57:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a palanquin for food
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.03,0:57:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and asked how you came up with such a wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.46,0:57:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The stump is clear, the result was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.30,0:57:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing was popular\Nin competitive Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.54,0:57:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Joseon delivery man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.91,0:57:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how proud I am of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.05,0:57:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Generally speaking, women from the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.95,0:57:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,should always be modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.05,0:57:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You are on me
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.65,0:57:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,are you grumbling now, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.49,0:57:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we be modest? \NThat was the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.32,0:57:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Life is hard, even if you live off pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what he’s talking about,\Nbut it still infuriates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.33,0:58:08.21,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We should be glad that Ovol was able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.21,0:58:10.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is a ray of hope in the darkness of failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.41,0:58:14.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I’m sure after what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.71,0:58:17.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you now better understand what kind of people the Kim clan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.28,0:58:21.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I didn’t think they were ready to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.49,0:58:23.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You must be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.65,0:58:26.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,However, this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.36,0:58:33.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,They will not forget this defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.63,0:58:39.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,There are rumors that the deceased king did not die from illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.74,0:58:42.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It turns out...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.27,0:58:48.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,He believed that the Kim clan was an ulcer on the body of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.51,0:58:51.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you know what you did wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.28,0:58:52.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,He deprived Kim Hong-geun of power
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.95,0:58:54.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and sentenced him to exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.52,0:58:57.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,King revises bribery law,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.69,0:58:59.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,so it is
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.86,0:59:02.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,crossed the path of the Kim clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.66,0:59:06.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,They are not the kind of people\Nwho will sit idly by.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.50,0:59:13.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.54,0:59:16.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,luck was on the side of the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.17,0:59:19.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and he found evidence against everyone who was behind these atrocities.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:30.55,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,After the death of the king
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.15,0:59:33.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and its food taster has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.52,0:59:35.59,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm sure he was poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.66,0:59:38.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If only we were faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.40,0:59:41.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the king would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.43,0:59:46.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Listen to me,\NIt’s not over for you yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.14,0:59:49.37,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but if you miss the moment, you won’t get anything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.04,0:59:52.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This time your maid Ovol suffered,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.98,0:59:56.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but next time you will be in her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.18,0:59:59.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will submit a petition
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.15,1:00:02.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,about depriving the queen of her title.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.52,1:00:05.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You don’t even have to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.89,1:00:08.79,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the king will meet us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.79,1:00:12.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You will only have to approve this idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.53,1:00:21.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Queen Mother, please forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.21,1:00:27.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.21,1:00:34.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You just need to take care of our king.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.49,1:00:39.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,After this the king will change\Nhis attitude towards the queen,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.82,1:00:42.59,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,will not see why she is doing all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.06,1:00:51.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s cloudy outside.\NIt seems like it’s going to rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.03,1:00:52.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Court lady Han,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.97,1:00:55.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the room is dark, light the candles.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.81,1:00:57.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I obey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.17,1:01:26.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you wait for the king, he will not come.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.40,1:01:29.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How do you know that...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.54,1:01:32.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Will you calm down only\Nwhen you take everything from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.94,1:01:35.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Did you change the letter?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.41,1:01:39.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You changed something more serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.78,1:01:41.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why can’t I replace such a small thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.19,1:01:47.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t understand what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.59,1:01:52.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I know you lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.33,1:01:59.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If the king finds out the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.30,1:02:02.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,then you will understand my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.77,1:02:06.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The feeling you get when you lose someone you care about.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.01,1:02:08.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How hard is it for you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,will look into his eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.55,1:02:15.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.06,1:02:26.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you want to keep everything a secret, leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.80,1:02:31.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You found my weak point.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.50,1:02:34.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Okay, tell this to the king,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.94,1:02:38.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but then you'll have to talk about something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.21,1:02:41.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You tried
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.61,1:02:44.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,kill the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.46,1:02:55.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,So you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.99,1:02:58.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You have
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.63,1:03:01.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,nothing will work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.04,1:03:08.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Someday you will lose
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.77,1:03:12.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,person dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.92,1:03:54.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.99,1:03:59.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.72,1:04:01.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.06,1:04:04.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,is weak when he feels guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.06,1:04:08.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is the price of survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.63,1:04:10.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.51,1:04:20.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is what you are willing to do to win the favor of the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.89,1:04:39.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Hurry up, put it away before everything gets wet!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.30,1:04:40.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.97,1:04:48.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It had been raining for several days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.27,1:04:50.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And finally he went.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.47,1:04:54.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In this life my position is higher than in the present one,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.95,1:04:57.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but why do I feel even worse?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.68,1:04:58.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.68,1:05:03.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,do you think I can have another life?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.92,1:05:07.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,According to the theory of parallel worlds, everything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.90,1:05:12.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.90,1:05:15.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is the life you are living now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.63,1:05:19.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But this is your other life.\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.54,1:05:21.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Some kind of damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.34,1:05:25.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,After I started communicating
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.34,1:05:28.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,spoke some gibberish to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:33.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then could this puppy\Nbe a human in a past life?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.18,1:05:35.79,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Everything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.99,1:05:37.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And the cook is a fool?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.42,1:05:44.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Or else. He was probably my subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.77,1:05:53.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You will always be Choi's court lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.90,1:05:56.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And you, Hongyong...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.01,1:05:58.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then my mom and dad
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.74,1:06:01.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,will they be happy in the next life?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.08,1:06:02.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.08,1:06:05.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,My mother only has four nails left.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:09.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,She lost her nails when she was sorting through stones in the cold winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.09,1:06:14.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In another life, will my mother have all her nails in place?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.89,1:06:17.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.43,1:06:19.76,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And the priest will have two eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.76,1:06:21.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What about your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.36,1:06:24.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-His eye was gouged out with a pitchfork.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.03,1:06:25.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Must have borrowed rice
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.84,1:06:28.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and did not pay interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.07,1:06:31.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And then the moneylenders collect the debts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.84,1:06:35.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In every yard there is someone who suffered from moneylenders.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.58,1:06:37.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.81,1:06:40.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In the next life, your mother\Nwill have beautiful healthy nails,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.72,1:06:42.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you won’t even need to do a manicure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.25,1:06:43.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And my father will have
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.75,1:06:47.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,such shining eyes, as if he were wearing contacts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.89,1:06:52.60,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I would like to see my mother with healthy nails.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.93,1:06:54.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Eh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.10,1:06:57.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.30,1:07:00.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I really want to see my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.14,1:07:06.21,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You didn’t get to see your mother’s face!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.31,1:07:07.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.48,1:07:11.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Well, why did you remember about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.98,1:07:14.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about this mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.32,1:07:17.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Ms. Li Sunxin, she is alive and well!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.62,1:07:20.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Even does Zumba!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.56,1:07:22.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why do you make me feel like an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.93,1:07:29.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Gathered in the royal kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.77,1:07:32.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,where the path is closed to women, and they whine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.10,1:07:34.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t understand women.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.78,1:07:40.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.45,1:07:43.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.89,1:08:00.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s raining, so everyone is sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.20,1:08:04.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Listen, bring me some pajeon with makgeolli.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.27,1:08:06.67,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Return to Daejojeon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.67,1:08:08.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The rain will continue to pour for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.27,1:08:11.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.51,1:08:13.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Have you become a meteorological computer?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.91,1:08:16.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.61,1:08:19.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but my wrist hurts a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.05,1:08:21.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,which means it will rain all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.82,1:08:25.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.86,1:08:27.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t know,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.73,1:08:32.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,when it hurts so much, it means
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.90,1:08:36.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,will fill all the barrels in just a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.27,1:08:39.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Will it fill the barrels in a couple of hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.80,1:08:43.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then there will be water in the lakes and wells?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.55,1:08:58.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.82,1:09:00.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I’m listening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.33,1:09:04.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Book of Changes
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.43,1:09:06.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,To make our nights with the queen more productive,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.80,1:09:09.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll go to bed after I read a little more.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.10,1:09:12.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It's late, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.80,1:09:14.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I obey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.38,1:09:25.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Notes on weapons and equipment
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.04,1:09:55.71,Default,flash 5,0,0,0,,I'll be back when you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.71,1:09:59.05,Default,flash 5,0,0,0,,Don’t come unless you’re ready to beg on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.08,1:10:01.55,Default,flash 5,0,0,0,,I told you not to come!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.43,1:10:14.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Every day I kneel,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.83,1:10:19.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but not to whom\NI should bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.95,1:10:30.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.11,1:10:32.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You'll get sick!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.98,1:10:34.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t care about illness!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.92,1:10:37.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Look, heaven is on my side!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.02,1:10:39.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh my God, madam, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.09,1:10:42.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.89,1:11:15.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.63,1:11:16.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.86,1:11:19.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And one more time!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.26,1:11:20.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.83,1:11:22.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That's it! Hooray! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.83,1:11:24.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.33,1:11:26.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.04,1:11:35.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What kind of woman is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.71,1:11:37.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You never know what's on her mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.91,1:11:40.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That's it! Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.52,1:11:43.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.25,1:11:48.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why are you without a support group?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.07,1:11:59.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Also decided to take a walk in the rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.47,1:12:03.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I came to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.44,1:12:06.31,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Forget it, I don’t care.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.31,1:12:07.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.74,1:12:09.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can't forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.91,1:12:12.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I’m telling you, I don’t care, why are you attached?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.08,1:12:14.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Attached?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.82,1:12:19.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I am a simple person.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.02,1:12:20.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Glad to see you - I’m swearing,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.56,1:12:22.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,grateful - I'm getting into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.89,1:12:24.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can’t stand sycophants,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.06,1:12:26.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.70,1:12:32.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:34.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I summoned the courage to apologize,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.27,1:12:36.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and this is what I get in response?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.67,1:12:39.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Listen, if only the one who needs an apology is
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.38,1:12:42.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,who apologizes, and not to the one who receives them, is that really an apology?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.98,1:12:48.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The royal family has its own rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.99,1:12:52.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How long are you going to talk so strangely?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.16,1:12:55.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Today only. This is the last day.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.73,1:13:00.06,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And tomorrow everything will fall into place!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.06,1:13:02.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That's it! Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.83,1:13:04.67,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.67,1:13:06.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-That's it!\N-Queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.87,1:13:08.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.41,1:13:13.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, come to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.64,1:13:15.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.08,1:13:21.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You offended me, so today we sleep separately.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.12,1:13:25.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Spend the night alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.76,1:13:31.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Thank God! I'm so glad to hear this!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.43,1:13:35.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What a great fellow I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.17,1:13:42.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Did you go outside without an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.94,1:13:45.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I sometimes like to take a walk without an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.84,1:13:49.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Feels like the rain is washing away all my worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.15,1:13:54.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Don’t be sad!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.25,1:13:56.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, go back inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.35,1:13:58.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What a nightmare! Empress!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.99,1:14:00.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.46,1:14:04.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What is this? Why would there be thunder?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.36,1:14:06.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Heaven is angry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.13,1:14:08.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get angry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.63,1:14:12.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I move my pelvis if it means\Nthat the rain will continue to pour for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.34,1:14:16.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.27,1:14:18.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.17,1:14:19.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.08,1:14:21.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.54,1:14:23.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The queen’s illness is getting worse day by day,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.95,1:14:26.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,she does not miss the chance to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.32,1:14:29.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The whole yard is shaking from her antics.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.25,1:14:33.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better to file a petition
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.69,1:14:35.66,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,about stripping her of her title?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.89,1:14:38.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-You're right.\N-Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.73,1:14:41.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s time for our clan
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.70,1:14:44.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,gather your strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.98,1:15:01.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When the enemy opens his defenseless neck,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.95,1:15:04.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you should grab it right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.49,1:15:12.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The core of our country is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.19,1:15:15.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Depriving the queen of her title is the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.57,1:15:27.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Once upon a time there was an immortal named Achilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.41,1:15:29.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And he had only one weak point.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.51,1:15:32.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Legends say that he died from an arrow shot into his heel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.55,1:15:35.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is how the expression "Achilles' heel" came about.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.42,1:15:37.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But the real reason for his death is,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.89,1:15:41.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,that Achilles did not have someone who would make him armored shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.02,1:15:42.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,They say...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.46,1:15:45.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If people wanted to get rid of their weak points, they would get rid of each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.90,1:15:48.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Avoid the threat...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.30,1:15:51.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We are each other's weak points,\Nthe reasons why we suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.94,1:15:57.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But we also protect and save each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.23,1:16:21.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Honyoung,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.03,1:16:24.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,be sure to buy land in Gangnam.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.80,1:16:27.37,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.14,1:16:30.67,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Lady Choi,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.27,1:16:33.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you've been through a lot because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.54,1:17:04.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.01,1:17:12.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Lake Chhundaji
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.23,1:17:29.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.07,1:17:31.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We need to celebrate somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.36,1:17:58.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Now everything will finally fall into place.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.73,1:20:14.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Queen is the most unusual and strange person{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:16.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}of everyone I know.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.20,1:20:18.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}As if she is not from our world.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.47,1:20:20.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whose soul do you want to summon?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.87,1:20:24.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}This woman is definitely crazy.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.41,1:20:26.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}The internal crisis is much worse,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.88,1:20:28.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}external problem. Don't agree?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.78,1:20:30.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you want to say that in the country{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.01,1:20:31.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}there was a problem that didn't exist before?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.25,1:20:32.31,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}It turns out...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.31,1:20:33.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}His Majesty's Interest in the Queen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.82,1:20:35.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}will become our weakness.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.95,1:20:39.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then today is our first day.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.05,1:20:40.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,


